1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 31]</font>

15
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,</font>

16
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have heard
that Prince Qin Mobai of Xizhao</font>

17
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has long held affection for you.</font>

18
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this true?</font>

19
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

20
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father said</font>

21
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this matter would damage my reputation,</font>

22
00:01:27,520 --> 00:01:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I cannot tell you.</font>

23
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then are you willing to marry</font>

24
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Qin Mobai of Xizhao?</font>

25
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants to marry me?</font>

26
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Great Emperor of Xizhao</font>

27
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has finally found his prince.</font>

28
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to seize this opportunity</font>

29
00:01:41,240 --> 00:01:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to propose a marriage alliance.</font>

30
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I am unwilling.</font>

31
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

32
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may not know.</font>

33
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father has wronged the Qin family.</font>

34
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Fourth Prince
hates me enough as it is.</font>

35
00:01:58,080 --> 00:01:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were to marry him,</font>

36
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a strange land with no one I know,</font>

37
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and without my father's protection,</font>

38
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid...</font>

39
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm also afraid</font>

40
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Fourth Prince of Xizhao</font>

41
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">might hold a grudge against us</font>

42
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because of the Qin family affair.</font>

43
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you are willing to marry him,</font>

44
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can turn swords into ploughshares</font>

45
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and continue the friendly ties;</font>

46
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't that be a double blessing?</font>

47
00:02:20,760 --> 00:02:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had a fierce temper
since I was a child.</font>

48
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A double blessing?</font>

49
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not necessarily.</font>

50
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's more likely to add frost to snow.</font>

51
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This concerns diplomatic relations.</font>

52
00:02:31,320 --> 00:02:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can it be treated as a game?</font>

53
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The matter is settled.</font>

54
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

55
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a marriage is arranged
by parental command</font>

56
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the matchmaker's word.</font>

57
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My father still suffers in prison.</font>

58
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you suddenly</font>

59
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">send me away to be married
so far from home?</font>

60
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo</font>

61
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">committed severe crimes.</font>

62
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though he is my honored mentor,</font>

63
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:05,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot bend the law for him.</font>

64
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, here's my plan.</font>

65
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you marry into Xizhao,</font>

66
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd take you as my adopted daughter</font>

67
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make you
Commandery Princess Minghua.</font>

68
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With this new bond,</font>

69
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could use it as a pretext</font>

70
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to order Duke Dingguo
to escort you to the wedding,</font>

71
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you two can meet again.</font>

72
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly?</font>

73
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty's word is his bond.</font>

74
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could it be false?</font>

75
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry and express your gratitude.</font>

76
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

77
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, wait.</font>

78
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you...</font>

79
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father?</font>

80
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, take your leave.</font>

81
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan, don't just stand there.</font>

82
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me move the luggage out.</font>

83
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My little sister</font>

84
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has grown up.</font>

85
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

86
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't say things like that
all of a sudden.</font>

87
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's really quite unsettling.</font>

88
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

89
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must speak with His Majesty.</font>

90
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As the eldest son,</font>

91
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should bear any catastrophe.</font>

92
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we must earn the right to see Father,</font>

93
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then I should be the one to do it.</font>

94
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our family</font>

95
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has no need to trade your future
for favors.</font>

96
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

97
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are you talking about?</font>

98
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this</font>

99
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a wonderful stroke of luck?</font>

100
00:04:56,520 --> 00:04:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

101
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you know?</font>

102
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A princess in a political marriage</font>

103
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not an easy role.</font>

104
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does His Majesty
take our family for?</font>

105
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First it was Father,</font>

106
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and now he's chosen you.</font>

107
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

108
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">watch your words.</font>

109
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things are different now.</font>

110
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you still want a place in Beiyuan?</font>

111
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I lose it, so be it.</font>

112
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already petitioned His Majesty,</font>

113
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">asking him to make me an envoy,</font>

114
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I can escort you
all the way to Xizhao.</font>

115
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you mad?</font>

116
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I'm gone,</font>

117
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're needed here more than ever</font>

118
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to smooth things over for Father's case.</font>

119
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This was Father's wish.</font>

120
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has returned home.</font>

121
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's in the front hall.</font>

122
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go say goodbye to Father.</font>

123
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

124
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

125
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

126
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

127
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have been an unfilial daughter.</font>

128
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can no longer stay by your side.</font>

129
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

130
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I cannot accept
such a grand gesture from you.</font>

131
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For your kindness in raising me,</font>

132
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can never repay you enough.</font>

133
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am your daughter.</font>

134
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always will be.</font>

135
00:06:14,360 --> 00:06:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

136
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have failed you.</font>

137
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, please don't say that.</font>

138
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

139
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made this decision on my own.</font>

140
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have spoiled me since I was little.</font>

141
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always indulged my every whim.</font>

142
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This time,</font>

143
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just consider it</font>

144
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">me being willful one last time.</font>

145
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This alliance affects
both nations' interests.</font>

146
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you arrive in Xizhao,</font>

147
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must not act on impulse.</font>

148
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:42,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

149
00:06:43,960 --> 00:06:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will be there with her.</font>

150
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

151
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty permitted you
to join the wedding escort</font>

152
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">out of respect for old bonds.</font>

153
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must tread carefully,</font>

154
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with utmost caution in all things.</font>

155
00:06:57,960 --> 00:06:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand?</font>

156
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will remember your words, Father.</font>

157
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

158
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am growing old.</font>

159
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two must walk</font>

160
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some paths ahead on your own.</font>

161
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't expect you
to bring glory to our family.</font>

162
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only wish for you both</font>

163
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to live safe and sound.</font>

164
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, I'm here.</font>

165
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can rest assured.</font>

166
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take good care of my sister.</font>

167
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone is waiting outside.</font>

168
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

169
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, I can't bear to leave you.</font>

170
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to go anymore, Father.</font>

171
00:07:42,080 --> 00:07:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

172
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take your sister and go.</font>

173
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

174
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

175
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a commandery princess
of Beiyuan now.</font>

176
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wherever I go, I'll have the upper hand.</font>

177
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, please take care of your health.</font>

178
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you worry about me at all.</font>

179
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will take good care of myself.</font>

180
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

181
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

182
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">here's what I think.</font>

183
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You owe me a wedding.</font>

184
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our wedding can wait.</font>

185
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I must attend</font>

186
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying and my brother's wedding.</font>

187
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little later is fine, isn't it?</font>

188
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me you want to force them
through the wedding ceremony.</font>

189
00:09:06,920 --> 00:09:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or</font>

190
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you want to witness
their wedding night?</font>

191
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not in the mood.</font>

192
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be serious.</font>

193
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

194
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could it be you're already tired of me?</font>

195
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you have something,</font>

196
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you stop cherishing it.</font>

197
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this good enough?</font>

198
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll do.</font>

199
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

200
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wanted to see you
in a wedding dress.</font>

201
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I did bring them all, didn't I?</font>

202
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,
I'll wear them for you every night.</font>

203
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You promise?</font>

204
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General.</font>

205
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Young General.</font>

206
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Meng, long time no see.</font>

207
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hold no official rank anymore.</font>

208
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not worthy of that title.</font>

209
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your father forged the Yangming Army.</font>

210
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though his gone,</font>

211
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will always be his subordinates.</font>

212
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

213
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's Beiyuan that wronged him.</font>

214
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not for the peace</font>

215
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he fought to bring to this land,</font>

216
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pouring his life's blood into it,</font>

217
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we</font>

218
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would have walked away long ago.</font>

219
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Uncle Meng,</font>

220
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please, never speak such words again.</font>

221
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ah, right.</font>

222
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Wei.</font>

223
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you still recognize her?</font>

224
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei?</font>

225
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's complicated.</font>

226
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll explain later.</font>

227
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Qin Wei.</font>

228
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Uncle Meng.</font>

229
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little rascals.</font>

230
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up and greet Mrs. Li.</font>

231
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Mrs. Li.</font>

232
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Li.</font>

233
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave General Li</font>

234
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your care from now on.</font>

235
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

236
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll always be</font>

237
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wherever he is.</font>

238
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

239
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are your plans going forward?</font>

240
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We plan to go to Xizhao first</font>

241
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to cure the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

242
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And after that,</font>

243
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll be free to roam</font>

244
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:17,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these splendid lands together.</font>

245
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The road ahead is rough.</font>

246
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let us escort you two</font>

247
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a while longer.</font>

248
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

249
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You absolutely must not</font>

250
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">defy His Majesty again</font>

251
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on my account.</font>

252
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're heading back to Guanzhou.</font>

253
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's on our way, after all.</font>

254
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who would dare say anything about it?</font>

255
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Post Station]</font>

256
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General, it's a bit shabby,</font>

257
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it's the only
post station around here.</font>

258
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please bear with it.</font>

259
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ignore him.</font>

260
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's always so fussy.</font>

261
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take it anymore.</font>

262
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm never riding in a carriage again.</font>

263
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My backside is about to fall apart.</font>

264
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:56,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful with those things.</font>

265
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare drop anything.</font>

266
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

267
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

268
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

269
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's Jun.</font>

270
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's find another inn.</font>

271
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not this one.</font>

272
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said yourself</font>

273
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that this is
the only post station around.</font>

274
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why switch?</font>

275
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go.</font>

276
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be others further away.</font>

277
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to crowd in with strangers.</font>

278
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

279
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many people.</font>

280
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just go.</font>

281
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll be packed everywhere.</font>

282
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move things back.</font>

283
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

284
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about</font>

285
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">saying hello?</font>

286
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

287
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know the Chief.</font>

288
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He definitely doesn't want
to see me now.</font>

289
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

290
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's off</font>

291
00:12:56,360 --> 00:12:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with his eyes.</font>

292
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is His Majesty thinking?</font>

293
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He knows the history
between our families.</font>

294
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't foresee this?</font>

295
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think</font>

296
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is Beiyuan's idea.</font>

297
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be Xizhao's.</font>

298
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please enlighten me, honey.</font>

299
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your brother</font>

300
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was forced to stay in Xizhao.</font>

301
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the Great Emperor of Xizhao,</font>

302
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">knowing your brother's bond
with Jiang Ying,</font>

303
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">seeks to use her to keep him in Xizhao.</font>

304
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know my brother.</font>

305
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he learns of this scheme,</font>

306
00:13:43,800 --> 00:13:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he may not go along willingly.</font>

307
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Plus, Duke Dingguo did horrible things.</font>

308
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the Chief and I
are caught in this mess.</font>

309
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Jiang Ying marries him...</font>

310
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly cannot rest easy.</font>

311
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

312
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

313
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your frown makes my heart ache.</font>

314
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop teasing.</font>

315
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried sick.</font>

316
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

317
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">actually, I only wish</font>

318
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to share your worry</font>

319
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and feel your pain.</font>

320
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't fret.</font>

321
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say it was too crowded here?</font>

322
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come back?</font>

323
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mind your own business. Now, step aside.</font>

324
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go take a look.</font>

325
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you own this inn or something?</font>

326
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clear the way, right now.</font>

327
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rank truly is a crushing weight.</font>

328
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were standing here perfectly fine.</font>

329
00:14:36,880 --> 00:14:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should we have to move,</font>

330
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just because you've arrived?</font>

331
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

332
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With you two standing there,</font>

333
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how are we supposed to get through?</font>

334
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each side has its own argument.</font>

335
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Both claim to be in the right.</font>

336
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

337
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's play a game.</font>

338
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you win,</font>

339
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will step aside.</font>

340
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you lose...</font>

341
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies.</font>

342
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Play with him.</font>

343
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

344
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I love games more than anything.</font>

345
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

346
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can do it!</font>

347
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch closely.</font>

348
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you see that?</font>

349
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which hand holds the silver?</font>

350
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This hand.</font>

351
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I clearly saw it in this hand.</font>

352
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Accept your loss gracefully.</font>

353
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't tell me you</font>

354
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">plan to act like a sore loser</font>

355
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right here in front of everyone.</font>

356
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

357
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

358
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well.</font>

359
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll challenge you myself.</font>

360
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Best of three. Do you dare?</font>

361
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

362
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A little girl would just cry
if she lost.</font>

363
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that right, brothers?</font>

364
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes!</font>

365
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think that's funny?</font>

366
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you on.</font>

367
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General,</font>

368
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm no match for you.</font>

369
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:38,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

370
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan, it's pouring out.
Where are you going?</font>

371
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show us that trick
you just pulled again.</font>

372
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let Mr. Jiang see it clearly.</font>

373
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A trick?</font>

374
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young General,</font>

375
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my skills are only fit
for the military camp.</font>

376
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, spare me.</font>

377
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one.</font>

378
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw it.</font>

379
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it.</font>

380
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then it must be this one.</font>

381
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

382
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it.</font>

383
00:16:13,280 --> 00:16:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

384
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is there nothing?</font>

385
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the silver?</font>

386
00:16:16,400 --> 00:16:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did the silver go?</font>

387
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hand it over.</font>

388
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:24,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're cheating!</font>

389
00:16:24,640 --> 00:16:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How shameless.</font>

390
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A street trick.</font>

391
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a game with you.</font>

392
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who has time for games with you?</font>

393
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Clear the way.</font>

394
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

395
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

396
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something to tell you.</font>

397
00:16:46,910 --> 00:16:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

398
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

399
00:16:51,450 --> 00:16:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

400
00:16:55,370 --> 00:16:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

401
00:17:00,050 --> 00:17:03,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

402
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

403
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

404
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

405
00:17:21,030 --> 00:17:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

406
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

407
00:17:29,750 --> 00:17:34,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

408
00:17:34,290 --> 00:17:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

409
00:17:38,270 --> 00:17:42,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

410
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
